### ============================================================
### Meritix - Chapter Module
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register

Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Administrator",
  "email": "admin@meritix.com",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}
### Login
### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@meritix.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}
